  "id": "learning-strategy",
  "term": "learning strategy",
  "definition": "A learning strategy is an approach a learner chooses and uses to handle a particular kind of material or task. Different strategies may work better for different goals, so learners benefit from knowing several and applying the one that best fits the content or skill involved.",
